<div class="container">
  <div class="card card-container text-card">
    <img id="profile-img" class="logo-image" src="/images/logo-big.png" />
    <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
    <div class="text">
      <h5>How do I sign up for a XECO online portal account?</h5>
      <p>To sign up, you must be an existing client of XECO energy corporation. If you are a XECO client and you haven’t had an account created for you, please <a href="mailto:support@xecoenergy.com">contact support</a> to get set up.</p>
      <hr/>

      <h5>How can I retrieve the email address I used to set up my account?</h5>
      <p>If you can’t remember which email you used to create your account (or if you’ve recently changed it and forgot), you can <a href="mailto:support@xecoenergy.com">contact us</a>. We will verify your identity with a few security questions, then help jog your memory.</p>
      <hr/>


      <h5>How do I find the Mesh ID for a new Switch or Meter?</h5>
      <p>The Mesh ID is the MAC address for the mesh node. If you don’t know how to find that information, <a href="mailto:support@xecoenergy.com">contact support</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

